//! Accent-folding table for the default collation (`utf8mb4_0900_ai_ci`).
//!
//! Generated by deriving MySQL's own primary weights: for every codepoint in the
//! Latin ranges we asked a real `utf8mb4_0900_ai_ci` column for
//! `WEIGHT_STRING(ch)` and recorded the ASCII string carrying the same weight.
//! Writing this table by hand would have been guesswork; deriving it means it
//! cannot disagree with the collation it claims to implement.
//!
//! Codepoints absent from this table (`þ`, `ŋ`, `ı`, ...) have their own primary
//! weight in MySQL and are deliberately *not* folded to ASCII.

